From c7d2893dfcd59d4aaa644f21177210a1cbb1bda9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mgs-chneider <mgs@schneiderundcie.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 12:00:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Repo-Hygiene: dead code and build-artifact cleanup

- Remove scripts/build.mjs: unused, imports posthtml/posthtml-include
  which aren't declared as dependencies; the root build.mjs (the one
  npm run build actually invokes) is the live implementation.
- Remove src/components/: unreferenced by any page, and its header.html
  had already diverged from the live src/partials/header.html.
- Untrack dist/index.html: dist/ is a generated build output and
  shouldn't be committed.
- Add .gitignore for node_modules/ and dist/.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
